## Layout

The code follows [Feature-Sliced Design](https://feature-sliced.design).
Each layer can import only from the layers below it.

| Folder          | Layer                                                   |
| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| `src/app/`      | The entry point, the providers, and the router.         |
| `src/pages/`    | One slice for each page of the definition.              |
| `src/widgets/`  | Large parts of a page, for example the app shell.       |
| `src/features/` | User actions, for example the forms.                    |
| `src/entities/` | The entity types and their data access.                 |
| `src/shared/`   | Code that does not know the domain: UI kit, lib, config. |

